      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Isuel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In her youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. She then became sovereign of her realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cillen",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without her knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Virgile",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A - INTRO - ELF",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022If we are to invade the lands of Fardale we will first need to solidify our hold on the Mercantile Sea and amass a force capable of dealing with the Empire on their own ground.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022So far, we have managed to pull through victorious despite all the challenges placed before us. A sign of divine favor, certainly. I know you are not sailors, but Gallean will guide us in this task.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022And you are to lead the centaurs? I doubt it...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022Why do you insist on challenging our every move?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Strider \n\u0022Isn\u0027t it obvious by now? We do not follow the \u0027noble\u0027 order! Why should we answer to you?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022Your orders are not from me; your orders are from Gallean! Have you forgotten why we do this?! We must focus on destroying the Empire\u0027s trade route at once! There are three ports here - take them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ELF - CAP DEVILS DEN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022What? New owners? Don\u0027t give a damn as long as I have a place to sell my services. Keep my rent the same and I won\u0027t gripe.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022What do you offer as services?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022Haha, ya intrested? Well, we do the more discreet things if you follow my drift! We can get you goods, information or even make people disappear, thanks to our silent friend here!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Greiss \n\u0022...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022A heretic! It follows your orders???\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022Well, we got a special agreement me and him. He listens, I feed him. Plus I think he enjoys all the killin\u0027 and chaos.\u0022 ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ELF - CAP - BANTHER",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022Whaa...hey...ELVES!! Loooong time not seen forest people here, yeah...what brings you to Banther\u0027s? Ahh...you need goods? Ohhhohoho Banther got em ALL!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022No, we are taking over the trade here, Human!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022TAKING OVER??? Yaaah...oh...Oh!! You mean you\u0027re replacing the Empire...GOOD!!! Those bastards just bad...they take and take and take and, well...that\u0027s it, they just take! No good business with them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022Ohh\u2026HA! You can be sure Banther will support you; he sees only good things from this, in fact...Here! Goods on me! Aren\u0027t I just perfect!? Oh yes I am!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ELF - CAP - SHADYA",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022So it\u0027s true! Yataa\u0027 Halli must be dead then! A shame, really, she carried the royal bloodline. Dwarves \u0027round here didn\u0027t much care for her though. Peace this...negotiations that. It wasn\u0027t Wotan\u0027s way!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Yes...well...we are taking over control of these trading lanes. What business do you run here?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Resources! All manner of minerals, iron, rocks and such! And not just from Dwarven mines, from all parts of Nevendaar. If someone is harvesting it, chances are we can get it for you! And at good prices!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022A Promising proposition, but we will leave some of our own here with you to work out the details. I trust you have no issues trading with Elves?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Gold is my only real friend. Anything else is just...as you said...details. As long as you have no trouble with me being a Dwarf, I think we can work it out!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - ELF WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022We have taken control of all the trading ports within Mercantile. Inform Serphis that we may start preparing our fleet for the invasion of Fardale.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN0038",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN003d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - EMPIRE WIN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001a",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Myzrael \n\u0022All trading ports have been secured. Contact the Emry at once and request support. We shall not give these Elves a second chance.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A - INTRO - EMPIRE",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Soldier \n\u0022Sir, the Elves have arrived within Mercantile. They seem to be after the trade ports.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001b",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Myzrael \n\u0022We cannot ignore this threat. Losing Mercantile will cripple the Empire\u0027s resources - prepare our defenses now. We must secure our hold on all ports.\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - BANTHER",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022NOOOO! Nah...Hmm? What now?? Banther has already given you ALL the goods! He has nothing, not even boots! Especially no boots! Why would I have boots!?  Hehe...Oh!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Quiet you gibbering simpleton, we are here to protect...not to use your worthless services!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022WORTHLESS??? Why YOU!! Umm, well... WELL...alright, you\u0027re right. So, a big Empire bear-man will protect poor ol\u0027 Banther? AMUSING!!! Yes.\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022He will protect this trading port, not you! Just cooperate!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - SHADYA",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We are bringing in new defenses, Bramdock. We have reason to believe someone is attempting to take control of Mercantile.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Alright, I suppose, but you think I can\u0027t defend myself? I\u0027m not of the \u0027diplomatic\u0027 school of thinkin\u0027, if you know what I mean.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022We happen to think you wouldn\u0027t care who controlled Mercantile as long as cash passed through your grubby little fingers. Whatever the case, we are placing additional defenses here.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Fine. When the cash flow stops, you\u0027ll hear my opinion.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "EMP - CAP - DEVIL",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022What is it now? Another Pilgrim needs to disappear? We aren\u0027t here to do all of your baby sitting jobs!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Not this time Thom, were adding defenses to your little hovel here. You should be happy...you are getting customers, something you lack!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022Shut your mouth! Bring on those mighty flying knights of yours. Don\u0027t blame me if you happen to find Greiss here chewing on one of them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232EV001e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022If we see your pet outside of his cage, we\u0027ll not just kill him. We\u0027ll remove you and your little band if thugs from Mercantile. I hear the krakens have a mighty appetite.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S232SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S232UN0042",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Imperial Assassin",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
